cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Symbolic-U in research, please cite the repository version or commit used."
title: "Symbolic-U"
authors:
  - name: "Arthur-KI"
version: "0.25.0"
date-released: "2026-09-02"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arthur-KI/symbolic-u"
url: "https://github.com/Arthur-KI/symbolic-u"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
abstract: >-
  A non-neural symbolic learning and reasoning research prototype using a small
  Key/U substrate, ternary proposition and derivation states, explicit opposition,
  query-guided backward proof, temporal/arithmetic reasoning, decomposable
  Macro-U compilation, classical visual tokenization and learned sensor selection.
keywords:
  - symbolic AI
  - reasoning
  - knowledge representation
  - inductive logic programming
  - program synthesis
  - computer vision
  - robotics
  - explainable AI
